   G/F/| ABGB              EB        e>b     |a/g/f/e/  g/f/e/^d/ eE       E  :|
   g/f/|:e>fg>e            g/a/b/g/  e>f     |d>fad               f/g/e/f/ d
[1 f   | e>fge             g/a/b/g/  ea      |g/a/b/g/  f/g/a/f/  ge       e>B:|
[2 a   | g/a/b/g/ f/g/a/f/ e/f/g/e/ ^d/e/f/d/|B/^c/d/B/ e/c/d/F/  GE       E  |]

